WEBVTT - Apache Solr (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:07.251
Solr finds your content, but its default templates look like another site.

2
00:00:08.351 --> 00:00:14.215
Desiderio’s templates give Solr’s results, filters and page numbers your theme.

3
00:00:15.465 --> 00:00:21.695
After three letters, suggestions and top results appear, usable with the keyboard.

4
00:00:22.745 --> 00:00:27.904
Active filters show as chips, and every option keeps its own count.

5
00:00:28.954 --> 00:00:35.105
Switch the preset or dark mode, and search follows, with no CSS of its own.

6
00:00:36.405 --> 00:00:39.761
Apache Solr, styled by Desiderio.
